How to generate:

1) sorted datasets
2) frequencies of datatset elements
3) mappings based on frequencies
4) datasets mapped on the basis of element frequencies
5) sorted mapped datasets

[set-similarity]$ ./sort-dataset.pl < dataset.txt > dataset.txt.sorted 
[set-similarity]$ ./symb-freq.pl < dataset.txt | sort -n -r -k2 > dataset.freq
[set-similarity]$ ./gen-map-onfreq.pl < dataset.freq > dataset.freq.map
[set-similarity]$ ./map-onfreq-dataset.pl dataset.freq.map < dataset.txt > dataset.txt.mapd
[set-similarity]$ ./sort-dataset.pl < dataset.txt.mapd > dataset.txt.mapd.sorted 






